### Cluster quorum unhealthy
For 5 minutes Portworx has reported a quorum problem. Without quorum, Portworx stops I/O to protect data.

#### Check first
1. [Cluster metrics](/#/components/{{ componentUrnForUrl }}/metrics) → **Health**: quorum and nodes online.
2. `kubectl -n <portworx-namespace> exec <px-cluster-pod> -c portworx -- /opt/pwx/bin/pxctl status` and `kubectl -n <portworx-namespace> exec <px-cluster-pod> -c portworx -- /opt/pwx/bin/pxctl cluster list`.

#### Fix
Bring enough storage nodes back online to restore a majority. Check the network between nodes first.
